// Copy this file to Signing.xcconfig and fill in your team.
//
//   cp Signing.xcconfig.example Signing.xcconfig
//
// Signing.xcconfig is git-ignored, so your team ID never lands in the repo.
// Find the ID in Xcode → Settings → Accounts → your Apple ID → Manage
// Certificates, or in the Apple Developer portal under Membership.
//
// Leave it empty and simulator builds still work — a team is only needed to
// install on a real iPhone.

